  "sourceTitle": "Wild Turkey Sour",
  "sourceText": "Wild Turkey Sour\nBy: Sheri Wetherell\nPublished: Saturday, December 12, 2009 - 11:38pm\n\nIngredients\n\n\n\n\n2 ounces Bourbon\n1 ounce Lemon juice\n1/2 teaspoon Superfine sugar\n1 slice Orange\n1 Maraschino cherry\n\nPreparation\n\n1 In a shaker half-filled with ice cubes, combine the bourbon, lemon juice, and sugar. Shake well. Strain into a whiskey sour glass, garnish with the orange slice and cherry.",
